        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandih khou muang#!7 gum liamma,",
            "Rianrmei kasu bang khou lou;",
            "Rianramei le jingmei khou hei,",
            "Theimei #!7 kasu bang khou lou.",
            "",
            "He rianra e, he rianra e,",
            "Pap #!7 rih dailiang e;",
            "Kalvari khou thei loumei tei,",
            "Sangam maknga ningtan makge.",
            "",
            "2. Poubaumei le kandih ram khou,",
            "Thou cho rih su tat nimei kiu?",
            "Tingkau bumang #!7 than bamma,",
            "Ai tat ni the suthan lou khang.",
            "",
            "He neila e, he neila e,",
            "Gospel phung guang meita;",
            "Nthuk pui pari phung guang mei tei,",
            "Phung guang mei tan hei gai dinge.",
            "",
            "3. Pap le jingmei tei tat kan the,",
            "Pap le jingmei khou bammei nun;",
            "Bethlehem munpuang guang dat ro,",
            "Jubili kang khuan kahao e.",
            "",
            "Halleluijah, halleluijah,",
            "Rianramei rih man the;",
            "Thuaihian liangmei poubaumei le,",
            "Nthuk pui pari tei gailiang e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
